sequenceDiagram
    actor SimpleFIN
    participant Sync
    participant Store
    participant Worker as Analysis Worker (15s)
    participant Registry as SQLite Adapter
    participant Frontend

    SimpleFIN->>Sync: BankDirective (Observe Facts)
    Sync->>Store: ApplySync
    Store->>Store: ObserveBankTransaction (facts_json upsert)
    Store->>Store: analysis_facts triggers bump analysis_inputs.revision

    loop every 15s
        Worker->>Registry: ClaimAnalysis (lease 60s, revision, input_json)
        Registry-->>Worker: AnalysisSnapshot (Revision + Transactions)
        Worker->>Worker: Analyze(ctx 20s, detectors BNPL/Recurring/Transfer)
        Worker->>Registry: CompleteAnalysis (publish only if revision matches)
        Registry-->>Worker: succeeded | superseded | failed (backoff 30s)
    end

    Frontend->>Worker: GET /v1/analyses (passive)
    Worker-->>Frontend: idle|queued|running
    Frontend->>Worker: GET /v1/analysis-findings (passive)
    Worker-->>Frontend: findings (identity, stale, dismissed)
    Frontend->>Worker: PATCH dismiss / POST feedback (confirm/reject/duration)
    Worker-->>Frontend: 200 / 409 (requestId conflict)
